      "text": "❤️For I-ARMY 💜Here is the quick and easy summary for your preparation strategy🥰\n⚖️The Smart & Balanced: 🇹🇼 Kaohsiung\n👉Why: Safe, tourist-friendly, and easy to travel around. Great hotel prices, but tickets are harder to get because international ARMY love this venue.\n🪙 Budget + Best Chance 🇲🇾 Kuala Lumpur\n👉Why: Highest stadium capacity (85K) means better chances of getting tickets, plus friendly hotel and travel costs.\n💳 Comfort + Big Budget: Singapore🇸🇬 & Hong Kong🇭🇰\n👉Why: Top-tier public transport, modern stadiums with roofs, and great social media vibes. Just be ready for expensive hotels.\n🎒The Budget but Hardcore: Bulacan🇵🇭\n👉Why: Very affordable stay, but a total nightmare for transport. The stadium is far from Manila, so you must prepare for massive traffic and pre-book your rides.\n🔥Hardcore: Bangkok🇹🇭\n👉Why: Pure \"war zone\" experience with crazy traffic and hot weather.",
